(window.LART=window.LART||{})["杂项/freopen"]="<h1>背景</h1>\n\n<p>不管是在noip，还是csp，输入输出都是<strong>文件输入输出</strong>，而不是控制台输入输出。</p>\n\n<p>如下图23年J组，T1 小苹果，必须从<code>apple.in</code>读数据，把数据输出到<code>apple.out</code>（否则这个题0分）。</p>\n\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"assets/attachments/be385e_Pasted image 20240903142431.png\" /></p>\n\n<h1>freopen的使用</h1>\n\n<p>在<strong>main函数开头</strong>写上。</p>\n\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"assets/attachments/3e6fb2_Pasted image 20240903143055.png\" /></p>\n\n\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">#include &lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main() {\n    freopen(&quot;apple.in&quot;, &quot;r&quot;, stdin); \n    freopen(&quot;apple.out&quot;, &quot;w&quot;, stdout);\n\n    int a, b;\n    cin &gt;&gt; a &gt;&gt; b;\n    cout &lt;&lt; a + b &lt;&lt; endl;\n\n    return 0;\n}\n</code></pre>\n\n<h2>解释</h2>\n<h3>输入重定向</h3>\n<p>将输入修改成从 apple.in 输入</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">freopen(&quot;apple.in&quot;, &quot;r&quot;, stdin);\n</code></pre>\n<p>r 是read， stdin 是标准输入。</p>\n<h3>输出重定向</h3>\n<p>将输出修改成输出到 apple.out</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">freopen(&quot;apple.out&quot;, &quot;w&quot;, stdout);\n</code></pre>\n<p>w 是write，stdout 是标准输出。</p>\n<div class=\"blanks\" style=\"height:1em\"></div>\n<h2>一定要注意</h2>\n\n<p>freopen没写好，此题的努力白费，100分变0分。</p>\n\n<p>①在<strong>输入输出之前</strong>，写上两句freopen。<br />\n<strong>输入输出之前</strong><br />\n<strong>输入输出之前</strong><br />\n②输入文件名的后缀是 .in，对应 r 和 stdin。<br />\n输入文件名的后缀是 .out，对应 w 和 stdout。<br />\n③参数不要写反了。错误示例：</p>\n\n\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">freopen(&quot;apple.in&quot;, stdin, &quot;r&quot;); \n</code></pre>\n\n<p>④\"r\"和\"w\"不要变成单引号。错误示例：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">freopen(&quot;apple.in&quot;, 'r', stdin); \n</code></pre>\n\n<p>⑤<strong>考试结束前10分钟，专门检查freopen有没有写好。</strong></p>\n\n<h1>错误示例</h1>\n<p>①不写freopen<br />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"assets/attachments/3a1dfa_Pasted image 20241004184511.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>②不写freopen+还没读入就使用<br />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"assets/attachments/63b8c4_Pasted image 20241004184624.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>③文件名不对<br />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"assets/attachments/e5a600_Pasted image 20241004184708.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>④输出freopen放到最后。<br />\n输出freopen的作用是：将输出改成输出到 <code>tree.out</code>。<br />\n下面错误例子是，输出结束了，再改成输出到 <code>tree.out</code>。<br />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"assets/attachments/6c3601_Pasted image 20241004184906.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>⑤忘记取消freopen的注释：<br />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"assets/attachments/d65707_Pasted image 20241004185145.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>⑥freopen里面内容错误。</p>\n\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"assets/attachments/b7ba44_Pasted image 20241004185720.png\" /><br />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"assets/attachments/b4c07f_Pasted image 20241004185627.png\" /></p>\n<div class=\"blanks\" style=\"height:2em\"></div>\n<p>⑦freopen不对应+注释freopen<br />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"assets/attachments/3a92e8_Pasted image 20241004190028.png\" /></p>";
